#. Description of the plugin
#: extonify-custom-emails-per-product.php
msgid "Send custom WooCommerce emails per product — either inserted into a native WooCommerce email or delivered as a separate message."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: extonify-custom-emails-per-product.php
